      "cooked": "<p>So I've noticed a couple times that sometimes Shock Rounds doesn't trigger when it should.</p><p>Start of Expat's turn, you can see all the HP values. I'm going to hit the Drum of Despair.</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/31zg6woa2jy1h3v/ShockNotWorking1.png?dl=0</p><p>Equipping shock rounds and targetting it</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/sax97uoh924vtp2/ShockNotWorking2.png?dl=0</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/31az5tevrru5rrt/ShockNotWorking3.png?dl=0</p><p>And Shock Rounds goes away, as you can see, only the drum got damaged.</p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/s/7k2d27qjwd7xv1k/ShockNotWorking4.png?dl=0</p><p>I've rewound it a couple times, and it still isn't working. Equipping it to Prejudice works fine, however.</p><p>Help?</p>",
